   16:26                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <p>Rearranging Your Brain for Success</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                                <div class=\"video-single\" data-time=\"50:19\">\n                    <div class=\"video-image\">\n                                                    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"170\" src=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-08-04-at-8.41.29-AM-300x170.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"The Hidden Cost of Negative Feedback\" srcset=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-08-04-at-8.41.29-AM-300x170.png 300w, https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-08-04-at-8.41.29-AM-768x434.png 768w, https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-08-04-at-8.41.29-AM-1024x579.png 1024w, https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-08-04-at-8.41.29-AM.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                                                            <div class=\"video-timestamp\">\n                                <svg width=\"96\" height=\"108\" viewBox=\"0 0 96 108\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                    <path d=\"M91.6162 46.9824C96.9495 50.0616 96.9495 57.7596 91.6162 60.8388L12.9797 106.24C7.64641 109.319 0.979746 105.47 0.979747 99.3114L0.979751 8.50985C0.979751 2.35144 7.64642 -1.49756 12.9798 1.58165L91.6162 46.9824Z\" fill=\"#fff\"></path>\n                                </svg>\n                                50:19                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <p>The Hidden Cost of Negative Feedback</p>\n                                    </div>\n                                                <div class=\"video-single\" data-time=\"01:16:55\">\n                    <div class=\"video-image\">\n                                                    <img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" src=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-08-04-at-8.41.09-AM-300x169.png\" class=\"attachment-medium size-medium\" alt=\"Frameworks for High-Stakes Decision-Making\" srcset=\"https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-08-04-at-8.41.09-AM-300x169.png 300w, https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-08-04-at-8.41.09-AM-768x432.png 768w, https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-08-04-at-8.41.09-AM-1024x576.png 1024w, https://fs.blog/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Screenshot-2026-08-04-at-8.41.09-AM.png 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />                                                                            <div class=\"video-timestamp\">\n                                <svg width=\"96\" height=\"108\" viewBox=\"0 0 96 108\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n                                    <path d=\"M91.6162 46.9824C96.9495 50.0616 96.9495 57.7596 91.6162 60.8388L12.9797 106.24C7.64641 109.319 0.979746 105.47 0.979747 99.3114L0.979751 8.50985C0.979751 2.35144 7.64642 -1.49756 12.9798 1.58165L91.6162 46.9824Z\" fill=\"#fff\"></path>\n                                </svg>\n                                01:16:55                            </div>\n                                            </div>\n                                            <p>Frameworks for High-Stakes Decision-Making</p>\n                                    </div>\n                            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // Add player to queue when DOM is ready\n        if (document.readyState === 'loading') {\n            document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n                if (window.FSBlogYouTube && window.FSBlogYouTube.addPlayerToQueue) {\n                    window.FSBlogYouTube.addPlayerToQueue(\"yt_player_495568\", \"pduZ-bfcKAQ\");\n                }\n            });\n        } else {\n            if (window.FSBlogYouTube && window.FSBlogYouTube.addPlayerToQueue) {\n                window.FSBlogYouTube.addPlayerToQueue(\"yt_player_495568\", \"pduZ-bfcKAQ\");\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Brad Jacobs has built eight billion-dollar companies, completed more than 500 acquisitions, and created extraordinary returns for shareholders over four decades. Few people understand how great businesses are built better than he does.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This conversation is about the principles behind that success. Brad explains how he spots trends before they become obvious, why psychology matters as much as strategy, and how he thinks about acquisitions, hiring, capital allocation, decision-making, and building organizations that consistently outperform.&nbsp;</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">He also shares lessons from therapy, meditation, and decades of leadership that changed how he manages people and makes decisions.</p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Listen Now: <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pduZ-bfcKAQ\">YouTube</a> | <strong><a href=\"https://open.spotify.com/episode/3k0q3Fsi8jbQDgUJROLpbF?si=ykyidSCLTWCMlP0-tQHQJg\">Spotify</a></strong></strong> | <strong><a href=\"https://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/the-mindset-behind-building-billion-dollar-companies/id990149481?i=1000779857908\">Apple Podcasts</a> | <a href=\"https://fs.blog/knowledge-project-podcast-transcripts/brad-jacobs-2/\">Transcript</a></strong></p>\n\n\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://fs.blog/knowledge-project-podcast/brad-jacobs-2/\">The Mindset Behind Building a Great Little Business | Brad Jacobs</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://fs.blog\">Farnam Street</a>.</p>\n"}